{"id": "7ab02bf1-f907-4295-8a17-71d7ebd7ada3", "slug": "aerith-fluid-engine", "title": "Aerith · Fluid Engine", "description": "Aerith Fluid Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Aerith · Fluid Engine\"\ndescription: \"Aerith Fluid Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#34D399\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#A7F3D0\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#061F14\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"2px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aerith · Fluid Engine\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 12; favorites: 2; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, support, flow, effect.\n## Overview\nAerith Fluid Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nAERITH SYSTEMS Fluid Dynamics Next-generation liquid rendering engine initializing. Calibrating physics solvers and preparing caustics simulation for seamless integration. 0 % Initializing STREAMING BUNDLE · 0.0 / 18.0…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Fluid Dynamics.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #34D399, secondary #000000, accent #A7F3D0, background #000000, surface #061F14, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover\">\n    <title>Aerith · Fluid Engine</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-[100svh] bg-neutral-950 text-emerald-50 overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-sans selection:bg-emerald-500/30 antialiased\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% -10%, #061f14 0%, transparent 55%), radial-gradient(140% 120% at 50% 120%, #02120a 0%, transparent 60%), linear-gradient(180deg, #040d0a 0%, #020605 100%);\">\n\n    <!-- Ambient WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"bg\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full block z-0 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas>\n\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-[min(92vw,51.25rem)] px-[clamp(1.25rem,5vw,3rem)] text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-[clamp(1.125rem,3.4vw,1.875rem)]\">\n\n        <!-- Company Header -->\n        <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-[0.7em] font-serif text-[clamp(0.75rem,1.4vw,0.875rem)] tracking-[0.36em] uppercase text-emerald-400 opacity-70\" id=\"eyebrow\">\n            <span class=\"w-[0.4375rem] h-[0.4375rem] rounded-full bg-emerald-400\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 12px 2px rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.8);\" id=\"dot\"></span>\n            AERITH SYSTEMS\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Main Title -->\n        <h1 class=\"m-0 text-[clamp(2.4rem,1.4rem+4.6vw,4.6rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.98] tracking-tighter text-transparent bg-clip-text\" id=\"title\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(100deg, #34d399 0%, #a7f3d0 42%, #fef08a 75%, #10b981 100%); background-size: 220% 100%;\">\n            Fluid Dynamics\n        </h1>\n\n        <!-- Subtitle for Masked Reveal -->\n        <p class=\"m-0 max-w-[46ch] text-[clamp(0.875rem,0.78rem+0.4vw,1rem)] leading-relaxed text-emerald-200/80\" id=\"subtitle\">\n            Next-generation liquid rendering engine initializing. Calibrating physics solvers and preparing caustics simulation for seamless integration.\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Meter Component -->\n        <section class=\"relative w-full mt-[clamp(0.25rem,1vw,0.625rem)]\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-[0.75rem] mb-[0.875rem] max-sm:flex-col max-sm:items-start max-sm:gap-[0.25rem]\">\n                <span class=\"flex items-baseline font-mono font-semibold leading-none text-emerald-50 opacity-90\" id=\"numWrap\" style=\"will-change: transform; text-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.28);\">\n                    <b id=\"pct\" class=\"text-[clamp(2.2rem,1.4rem+3.4vw,3.4rem)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\">0</b>\n                    <i class=\"not-italic text-[clamp(1rem,0.7rem+1vw,1.4rem)] text-emerald-400 ml-[0.15em] -translate-y-[0.15em]\">%</i>\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"font-mono text-[clamp(0.66rem,0.6rem+0.4vw,0.8rem)] tracking-[0.16em] uppercase text-emerald-200/60 text-right pb-[0.4em] max-sm:text-left\" id=\"status\">\n                    Initializing\n                </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Track -->\n            <div id=\"track\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Liquid loading progress\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"0\"\n                 class=\"relative w-full h-[clamp(6rem,17vh,9.375rem)] rounded-full overflow-hidden isolate\"\n                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(2, 20, 14, 0.92) 0%, rgba(1, 12, 8, 0.96) 100%); border: 1px solid transparent; background-clip: padding-box; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 1px rgba(167, 243, 208, 0.10), inset 0 -18px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65), 0 30px 70px -28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\">\n\n                <!-- Border Gradient Layer -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full pointer-events-none -z-10\" style=\"padding: 1px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(167, 243, 208, 0.2) 0%, rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.05) 100%); -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0); -webkit-mask-composite: xor; mask-composite: exclude;\"></div>\n\n                <div id=\"fallback\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-[62%] rounded-inherit z-0\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.5) 0%, rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.65) 100%); box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);\"></div>\n\n                <canvas id=\"liquid\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full block z-10 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas>\n\n                <!-- SVG Foam -->\n                <div id=\"foamWrap\" class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-0 overflow-hidden z-20 pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen opacity-50\" style=\"-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #000 0%, #000 22%, transparent 58%); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #000 0%, #000 22%, transparent 58%);\">\n                    <svg id=\"foamSvg\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 h-full block\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                        <defs>\n                            <filter id=\"foamF\" x=\"0%\" y=\"0%\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n                                <feTurbulence type=\"fractalNoise\" baseFrequency=\"0.012 0.07\" numOctaves=\"2\" seed=\"3\" stitchTiles=\"stitch\" result=\"n\">\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"seed\" values=\"3;9;5;12;7;2;10;4\" dur=\"4.5s\" calcMode=\"discrete\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                                </feTurbulence>\n                                <feColorMatrix in=\"n\" type=\"matrix\" values=\"0 0 0 0 0.6 0 0 0 0 0.9 0 0 0 0 0.7 0 0 0 2.6 -1.15\" />\n                            </filter>\n                        </defs>\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" filter=\"url(#foamF)\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Ticks -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-30 pointer-events-none flex justify-around items-center px-[25%]\">\n                    <span class=\"w-[1px] h-[56%] bg-emerald-100/20 tick opacity-16\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"w-[1px] h-[56%] bg-emerald-100/20 tick opacity-16\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"w-[1px] h-[56%] bg-emerald-100/20 tick opacity-16\"></span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Crest -->\n                <div id=\"crest\" class=\"absolute inset-y-[7%] left-0 w-[2px] z-30 -translate-x-[1px] pointer-events-none rounded-[2px] opacity-70\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0%, rgba(167, 243, 208, 0.95) 35%, rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.75) 70%, transparent 100%); box-shadow: 0 0 14px 2px rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.55);\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Gloss -->\n                <div id=\"gloss\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-40 pointer-events-none rounded-inherit mix-blend-screen\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(100deg, transparent 32%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 50%, transparent 68%); background-size: 260% 100%; background-position: 130% 0;\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Base Glow -->\n            <div id=\"glow\" class=\"absolute left-1/2 -bottom-[1.625rem] w-[82%] h-[2.875rem] -translate-x-1/2 blur-[0.75rem] opacity-25 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(60% 100% at 50% 0%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.45), transparent 72%);\"></div>\n\n            <p class=\"mt-[1.625rem] mb-0 font-mono text-[clamp(0.62rem,0.56rem+0.4vw,0.74rem)] tracking-[0.12em] text-emerald-200/50 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-[1.2em]\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span>STREAMING BUNDLE · <b id=\"caption\" class=\"text-emerald-400 font-semibold\">0.0</b> / 18.0 MB</span>\n            </p>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n    (function () {\n        \"use strict\";\n\n        // GSAP Setup\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\").matches;\n        const isMobile = window.matchMedia(\"(max-width: 640px)\").matches;\n\n        // Elements\n        const bgCanvas = document.getElementById(\"bg\");\n        const liqCanvas = document.getElementById(\"liquid\");\n        const track = document.getElementById(\"track\");\n        const foamWrap = document.getElementById(\"foamWrap\");\n        const foamSvg = document.getElementById(\"foamSvg\");\n        const crest = document.getElementById(\"crest\");\n        const glow = document.getElementById(\"glow\");\n        const pctEl = document.getElementById(\"pct\");\n        const statusEl = document.getElementById(\"status\");\n        const captionEl = document.getElementById(\"caption\");\n        const numWrap = document.getElementById(\"numWrap\");\n        const fallback = document.getElementById(\"fallback\");\n\n        // UI Animations using GSAP (Replacing CSS Keyframes)\n        if (!prefersReduced) {\n            // Pulse dot\n            gsap.to(\"#dot\", { scale: 1.5, opacity: 0.4, duration: 1.2, repeat: -1, yoyo: true, ease: \"sine.inOut\" });\n            gsap.to(\"#eyebrow\", { opacity: 1, letterSpacing: \"0.42em\", duration: 2.1, repeat: -1, yoyo: true, ease: \"sine.inOut\" });\n\n            // Flow title gradient\n            gsap.to(\"#title\", { backgroundPosition: \"100% 50%\", duration: 4.5, repeat: -1, yoyo: true, ease: \"sine.inOut\" });\n\n            // Text shadow glow\n            gsap.to(numWrap, { textShadow: \"0 0 30px rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.55)\", duration: 1.8, repeat: -1, yoyo: true, ease: \"sine.inOut\" });\n\n            // Status pulse\n            gsap.fromTo(statusEl, { opacity: 0.6 }, { opacity: 1, duration: 1.4, repeat: -1, yoyo: true, ease: \"sine.inOut\" });\n\n            // Crest breathing\n            gsap.to(crest, { opacity: 1, scaleY: 1.06, duration: 1.15, repeat: -1, yoyo: true, ease: \"sine.inOut\" });\n\n            // Ticks shimmer\n            gsap.utils.toArray('.tick').forEach((tick, i) => {\n                gsap.to(tick, { opacity: 0.5, duration: 1.6, delay: i * 0.5, repeat: -1, yoyo: true, ease: \"sine.inOut\" });\n            });\n\n            // Gloss sweep\n            gsap.to(\"#gloss\", { backgroundPosition: \"-60% 0\", duration: 6.5, repeat: -1, ease: \"none\" });\n\n            // Masked Word Reveal on Subtitle\n            const subtitleText = document.getElementById(\"subtitle\");\n            const words = subtitleText.innerText.split(\" \");\n            subtitleText.innerHTML = \"\";\n            words.forEach(word => {\n                const outer = document.createElement(\"span\");\n                outer.className = \"inline-flex overflow-hidden mr-[0.25em] align-top\";\n                const inner = document.createElement(\"span\");\n                inner.className = \"inline-block transform translate-y-[110%] opacity-0\";\n                inner.innerText = word;\n                outer.appendChild(inner);\n                subtitleText.appendChild(outer);\n            });\n\n            gsap.to(subtitleText.querySelectorAll(\"span > span\"), {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n        }\n\n        /* ---------- GLSL Strings ---------- */\n        const VERT = \"attribute vec2 aPos; void main(){ gl_Position = vec4(aPos, 0.0, 1.0); }\";\n        const NOISE = [\n            \"float hash(vec2 p){ p = fract(p * vec2(123.34, 456.21)); p += dot(p, p + 45.32); return fract(p.x * p.y); }\",\n            \"float noise(vec2 p){ vec2 i = floor(p), f = fract(p); vec2 u = f*f*(3.0-2.0*f);\",\n            \"  float a = hash(i), b = hash(i+vec2(1.,0.)), c = hash(i+vec2(0.,1.)), d = hash(i+vec2(1.,1.));\",\n            \"  return mix(mix(a,b,u.x), mix(c,d,u.x), u.y); }\",\n            \"float fbm(vec2 p){ float v = 0.0, a = 0.5; for(int i=0;i<OCT;i++){ v += a*noise(p); p *= 2.02; a *= 0.5; } return v; }\"\n        ].join(\"\\n\");\n\n        // Emerald/Charcoal Background\n        const BG_FRAG = [\n            \"precision highp float;\",\n            \"uniform vec2 uRes; uniform float uTime;\",\n            NOISE,\n            \"void main(){\",\n            \"  vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / uRes;\",\n            \"  vec2 p = uv; p.x *= uRes.x / uRes.y;\",\n            \"  float t = uTime * 0.04;\",\n            \"  float f = fbm(p * 1.8 + vec2(0.0, t));\",\n            \"  f = fbm(p * 1.8 + f * 1.1 + vec2(-t*0.6, t*0.9));\",\n            \"  vec3 deep = vec3(0.005, 0.02, 0.012);\",\n            \"  vec3 mid  = vec3(0.015, 0.06, 0.035);\",\n            \"  vec3 glw  = vec3(0.05, 0.2, 0.12);\",\n            \"  vec3 col = mix(deep, mid, smoothstep(0.15, 0.85, f));\",\n            \"  float cx = abs(sin(p.x*5.0 + f*2.0));\",\n            \"  float cy = abs(sin(p.y*5.0 - t*3.0 + f*2.0));\",\n            \"  float caus = pow(cx*cy, 3.0);\",\n            \"  col += glw * caus * 0.5;\",\n            \"  col += vec3(0.01, 0.05, 0.03) * pow(uv.y, 1.5) * 0.8;\",\n            \"  float ray = pow(max(0.0, sin(uv.x*3.0 - t*2.0)), 8.0) * uv.y * 0.06;\",\n            \"  col += vec3(0.05, 0.15, 0.1) * ray;\",\n            \"  float vig = smoothstep(1.35, 0.25, length(uv - 0.5));\",\n            \"  col *= mix(0.55, 1.0, vig);\",\n            \"  gl_FragColor = vec4(col, 1.0);\",\n            \"}\"\n        ].join(\"\\n\").replace(\"OCT\", String(isMobile ? 2 : 3));\n\n        // Mint/Emerald Liquid\n        const LIQ_FRAG = [\n            \"precision highp float;\",\n            \"uniform vec2 uRes; uniform float uTime;\",\n            \"uniform float uProgress; uniform float uSlosh; uniform float uAmp;\",\n            NOISE,\n            \"float bubbles(vec2 uv, float t){\",\n            \"  float s = 0.0;\",\n            \"  for(int i=0;i<3;i++){ float fi = float(i);\",\n            \"    vec2 g = uv * vec2(7.0 + fi*3.0, 2.0 + fi*0.8) + vec2(fi*9.1, 0.0);\",\n            \"    g.y += t * (0.30 + 0.18*fi);\",\n            \"    vec2 id = floor(g), fr = fract(g);\",\n            \"    float h = hash(id + fi*5.0), h2 = hash(id + fi*5.0 + 2.3);\",\n            \"    vec2 c = vec2(0.22 + 0.56*h, 0.5);\",\n            \"    float r = 0.08 + 0.10*h2;\",\n            \"    float d = length(fr - c);\",\n            \"    s += smoothstep(r, r*0.15, d) * (0.45 + 0.55*h);\",\n            \"  } return s * 0.45;\",\n            \"}\",\n            \"void main(){\",\n            \"  vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / uRes;\",\n            \"  float t = uTime;\",\n            \"  float crest = sin(uv.y*8.0 + t*2.1) * 0.45\",\n            \"              + sin(uv.y*15.0 - t*3.0) * 0.27\",\n            \"              + sin(uv.y*4.0 + t*1.2) * 0.30;\",\n            \"  crest += uSlosh * (uv.y - 0.5) * 2.2;\",\n            \"  float amp = 0.010 + uAmp * 0.055;\",\n            \"  float front = uProgress + crest * amp;\",\n            \"  float aa = 2.0 / uRes.x;\",\n            \"  float liquid = smoothstep(front + aa, front - aa, uv.x);\",\n            \"  vec2 q = uv * vec2(3.2, 1.7);\",\n            \"  float fl = fbm(q + vec2(t*0.10, t*0.05));\",\n            \"  fl = fbm(q + fl + vec2(-t*0.07, t*0.09));\",\n            \"  vec3 deep  = vec3(0.01, 0.12, 0.08);\",\n            \"  vec3 mid   = vec3(0.04, 0.45, 0.30);\",\n            \"  vec3 brite = vec3(0.3, 0.9, 0.55);\",\n            \"  vec3 col = mix(deep, mid, smoothstep(0.05, 0.9, fl));\",\n            \"  col = mix(col, brite, smoothstep(0.55, 1.0, fl) * 0.5);\",\n            \"  col += vec3(0.02, 0.1, 0.08) * smoothstep(0.25, 1.0, uv.y);\",\n            \"  col += bubbles(uv, t) * vec3(0.6, 0.95, 0.7);\",\n            \"  float foam = smoothstep(0.045, 0.0, abs(uv.x - front));\",\n            \"  col += foam * vec3(0.8, 1.0, 0.9);\",\n            \"  float gloss = smoothstep(0.02, 0.0, abs(uv.y - 0.80));\",\n            \"  col += gloss * vec3(0.3, 0.6, 0.5) * 0.7;\",\n            \"  col *= mix(0.55, 1.0, smoothstep(0.0, 0.55, uv.y));\",\n            \"  gl_FragColor = vec4(col, liquid);\",\n            \"}\"\n        ].join(\"\\n\").replace(\"OCT\", String(isMobile ? 3 : 4));\n\n        /* ---------- WebGL Layer Factory ---------- */\n        function makeLayer(canvas, frag, opaque) {\n            let gl;\n            try {\n                gl = canvas.getContext(\"webgl\", {\n                    antialias: false, alpha: !opaque, premultipliedAlpha: false,\n                    depth: false, stencil: false, powerPreference: \"low-power\"\n                }) || canvas.getContext(\"experimental-webgl\");\n            } catch (e) { gl = null; }\n            if (!gl) return null;\n\n            function comp(type, src) {\n                const sh = gl.createShader(type);\n                gl.shaderSource(sh, src); gl.compileShader(sh);\n                if (!gl.getShaderParameter(sh, gl.COMPILE_STATUS)) {\n                    console.warn(\"shader compile:\", gl.getShaderInfoLog(sh));\n                    gl.deleteShader(sh); return null;\n                }\n                return sh;\n            }\n            const vs = comp(gl.VERTEX_SHADER, VERT);\n            const fs = comp(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, frag);\n            if (!vs || !fs) return null;\n\n            const prog = gl.createProgram();\n            gl.attachShader(prog, vs); gl.attachShader(prog, fs); gl.linkProgram(prog);\n            if (!gl.getProgramParameter(prog, gl.LINK_STATUS)) {\n                console.warn(\"link:\", gl.getProgramInfoLog(prog)); return null;\n            }\n            gl.useProgram(prog);\n\n            const buf = gl.createBuffer();\n            gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buf);\n            gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array([-1, -1, 3, -1, -1, 3]), gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n            const aPos = gl.getAttribLocation(prog, \"aPos\");\n            gl.enableVertexAttribArray(aPos);\n            gl.vertexAttribPointer(aPos, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n\n            const u = {};\n            [\"uRes\", \"uTime\", \"uProgress\", \"uSlosh\", \"uAmp\"].forEach(n => {\n                const l = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, n); if (l) u[n] = l;\n            });\n\n            return {\n                gl, u,\n                draw() {\n                    gl.clearColor(0, 0, 0, 0);\n                    gl.clear(gl.COLOR_BUFFER_BIT);\n                    gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLES, 0, 3);\n                },\n                dispose() {\n                    try {\n                        gl.deleteBuffer(buf); gl.deleteProgram(prog);\n                        gl.deleteShader(vs); gl.deleteShader(fs);\n                        const lose = gl.getExtension(\"WEBGL_lose_context\");\n                        if (lose) lose.loseContext();\n                    } catch (e) {}\n                }\n            };\n        }\n\n        const bg = makeLayer(bgCanvas, BG_FRAG, true);\n        const lq = makeLayer(liqCanvas, LIQ_FRAG, false);\n\n        if (!bg)